Dear Summer Adventure lovers,

We have been eagerly waiting for this moment and are happy to announce that My Summer Adventure is now available on mobile devices! Download the game via Google Play  and embark on an unforgettable summer journey from anywhere in the world now.

Here is what the mobile version of My Summer Adventure has in store for you:
An intriguing love story;
Colorful locales of modern Japan;
Many different and unexpected endings;
 Gorgeous anime-style illustrations;
A narrative full of decisions that will affect the characters’ fate.
Do not miss the opportunity to live out your very own unforgettable summer with My Summer Adventure on mobile devices!
